### Negative control for `make reasoner`: a teacher assertion whose teacher is a
### Style. The ontology says a TeacherAssertion's teacher is a Person, and Person
### and Style are disjoint, so the graph is inconsistent - but only if the
### martialis:teacher triple reaches HermiT as an object property assertion. If
### the reasoner step ever parses data without the ontology's declarations
### again (every property value then becomes an ignored annotation), this
### fixture reasons as consistent and the step fails.

@prefix martialis: <https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology#> .

<https://martial.is/entity/control-teacher-claim> a martialis:TeacherAssertion ;
    martialis:teacher <https://martial.is/entity/control-style> .

<https://martial.is/entity/control-style> a martialis:Style .
